WEBVTT

00:06:55.579 --> 00:07:02.871
Escalation is where people make errors
because of their ego and their emotions.

00:07:03.413 --> 00:07:06.913
It's not just a cold calculation
of the loss of money or time.

00:07:07.288 --> 00:07:10.454
It's the hot pain of threats
to our sense of self.

00:07:10.621 --> 00:07:16.663
They're afraid to admit a mistake
and they end up justifying

00:07:16.663 --> 00:07:18.079
a decision to themselves.

00:07:18.079 --> 00:07:22.413
In a case like this, I'm trying to protect
my ego to convince myself that

00:07:22.413 --> 00:07:23.704
I didn't make a bad choice.

00:07:24.204 --> 00:07:28.871
I'm also trying to protect my image, to
convince others that I made a good choice,

00:07:29.454 --> 00:07:30.704
because otherwise